"直方图：R/G/B 三组曲线，重叠处按光叠加（R+G 为黄，三路齐为白）；亮度仍测量并用于过白/削顶/削底读数，但不再画线。横轴 {0} 档 SDR 码值 + {1} 档高光尾。下面一行随鼠标变化：鼠标在画面上时是鼠标处像素的 R/G/B 三通道值（画面本身的光，不是屏幕渲染后的值：SDR 区为 0–255 码值，超白通道为 +x.x 档并画成削顶品红），鼠标在直方图上时是那一箱的 R/G/B 样本数，其他位置为空但行高不变。" = "Histogram: three curves, R, G and B; where they overlap the light adds up (R+G reads yellow, all three read white). Luminance is still measured and drives the above-white/clipped-highlight/clipped-shadow readouts, but is no longer drawn. The horizontal axis is {0} stops of SDR code values plus a {1}-stop highlight tail. The line below follows the mouse: over the image it shows the R/G/B of the pixel under the cursor (the light in the picture, not the rendered screen: SDR codes 0–255, super-white channels as +x.x stops drawn in clipped magenta); over the histogram it shows that bin’s R/G/B sample counts; elsewhere it is empty but keeps its height.";
"直方图：R/G/B 三组曲线，重叠处按光叠加（R+G 为黄，三路齐为白）；亮度用于过白、削顶和削底读数，不单独画线。横轴 {0} 档 SDR 码值 + {1} 档高光尾。下方读数跟随鼠标：在照片上显示当前 HDR/SDR 预览映射后的像素 R/G/B 值（SDR 为 0–255，超白为 +x.x 档）；在直方图上显示该箱的 R/G/B 样本数。" = "Histogram: three additive R/G/B curves (red plus green is yellow; all three are white). Luminance measures over-white and clipping but is not drawn. The axis has {0} SDR code bins and {1} highlight-tail bins. Over the image, the pointer readout shows R/G/B after the current HDR/SDR preview mapping (SDR codes 0–255; above-white values in stops). Over the histogram, it shows R/G/B sample counts for that bin.";
